== 15. Bravo blocks without a task reference
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Waiting on access", "kind": "blocker", "submission_id": "submission-9", "token": "<token-3>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "result": {
    "message_id": 9
  }
}

